<#ff8c3c>PEEK-A-BOO</>
Peek-a-boo (hold)		^X
  He weaves forward and slips standing and air attacks and
  projectiles. Let go of X to stop.
Liver Blow (from the weave)		^A
Gazelle Punch (from the weave)		^B
Dempsey Roll (from the weave)		^C
  Liver Blow and Gazelle hits cancel back into the weave if
  X is still held.

<#ff8c3c>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
Back Throw		_B^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B

<#ff8c3c>NORMALS</>
Jab / Straight / Hook		^A / ^B / ^C
  Chain: A, A, B, C. Every normal cancels into specials.
Crouching Light / Medium		_D^A / _D^B
Launcher		_D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Any hit on an airborne opponent knocks them down.

<#ff8c3c>SPECIALS</>
  The C version is the EX (500 meter).
Dempsey Roll		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  Rushes in and unloads. EX: last hit wall-bounces them.
Gazelle Punch		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
  EX: launches high and cancels into a super.
Twisting Gut Blow		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  EX: staggers them for a free combo.

<#ff8c3c>SUPERS</>
Hyper Dempsey Roll Combo (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Hyper Gazelle Barrage (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Desperation Gut Blow (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Any two of A/B/C work for the two-button supers.
